{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.IdealTetFacesFromInscribedTriangle","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IdealTetFacesFromInscribedTriangle","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicDihedralAngle"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.infedge_orientation_P1_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.infedge_orientation_P1_C","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/IdealTetFacesFromInscribedTriangle.lean#L133-L149","doc":"P₁ face over chord 3 (`s = −1`) points into the wedge: negative dot with the\nchord-1 normal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.infedge_orientation_P1_A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.infedge_orientation_P1_A","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/IdealTetFacesFromInscribedTriangle.lean#L115-L131","doc":"P₁ face over chord 1 (`s = +1`) points into the wedge: negative dot with the\nchord-3 normal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.chimney_infedge_dihedral_eq_vertexAngle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.chimney_infedge_dihedral_eq_vertexAngle","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/IdealTetFacesFromInscribedTriangle.lean#L60-L105","doc":"**The three ∞-edge dihedral angles of the chimney over the inscribed triangle\nare the triangle's vertex angles `(α, β, γ)`.**\n\nThe interior edge-perpendicular in-face vectors are exhibited explicitly (with\ntheir orientation signs), and the dihedral angle along each ∞-edge is computed\ndirectly via `dihedralAngle_edgePerp`.  No geometry is assumed beyond File 1's\nconformality — this is a real computation of the three angles. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.chordNormal_unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.chordNormal_unit","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/IdealTetFacesFromInscribedTriangle.lean#L57-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.chordNormal_snd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.chordNormal_snd","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/IdealTetFacesFromInscribedTriangle.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.chordNormal_fst","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.chordNormal_fst","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/IdealTetFacesFromInscribedTriangle.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.chordNormal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.chordNormal","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/IdealTetFacesFromInscribedTriangle.lean#L49-L52","doc":"The **outward base normal** of the chord half-plane at central direction `θ`:\nthe unit vector `(cos θ, sin θ)`.  (Matches `chordHalfplane _ θ _`'s functional\n`w·(cos θ, sin θ)`.) ","signatureChunk":0}]}